# Spend Sense Model News — weekly collection (example, not installed).
#
# Install AFTER the activation steps in news-feed/README.md, by merging with
# the account's existing entries (`crontab -e`). The script is silent on
# success, so MAILTO delivers failure output only.
#
# Runs Mondays at 04:17 server time. Confirm the host clock (`date`) reads
# the expected zone before relying on the weekday.

MAILTO="you@example.com"
17 4 * * 1 /bin/sh $HOME/spendsense-feed/repo/news-feed/collect.sh
